From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Varagnat <emmanuel.varagnat@vates.tech>
Date: Fri, 16 Jan 2026 09:47:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] build: add C11 compatibility flag (-std=gnu11 in fact for
 GCC)

Some part of the project won't compile with ISO C11, and some part
requires atomics from C11.

Signed-off-by: Emmanuel Varagnat <emmanuel.varagnat@vates.tech>
---
 configure.ac | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
index 735d468c..7aecfbf7 100644
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -3,6 +3,8 @@ AC_INIT([blktap], BLKTAP_VERSION)
 AM_INIT_AUTOMAKE([foreign])
 # AM_SILENT_RULES([yes])
 
+CFLAGS="$CFLAGS -std=gnu11"
+
 AC_PROG_CC
 AC_PROG_LIBTOOL
 AC_PROG_INSTALL
